   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "reads as an addition on\nfirst look and is the\nopposite. derived-from-\ndisk applies: a value the\nmachine can compute is\nnever asked for twice.",
